OL,3,GNEWSAFree community library
OL,4,A'unrecognisable' after fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA free community library in Cheshire
OL,7,Fhas been left "unrecognisable" by the
OL,8,Feffects of a fire that police believe
OL,9,Fwas started deliberately.
OL,11,FThe small wooden hut at Lyme Green
OL,12,FCommunity Park in Macclesfield allowed
OL,13,Fpeople to donate and borrow books, but
OL,14,Fits contents have been left badly
OL,15,Fburnt.
OL,17,FResident Elliot Smith, 31, who has
OL,18,Flaunched a fundraising appeal to
OL,19,Freplace it, said he was saddened to see
OL,20,Fdestroyed books and blackened shelves.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
